 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/notifications/settings`
+
+Returns the current user's notification settings.
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "bundle_email_frequency": "daily"
+}
+```
+
+## `PATCH /:account_slug/notifications/settings`
+
+Sets how often notifications are bundled into an email. Rather than one email per
+notification, notifications are collected into a window of time and sent as a single
+email when the window closes. The window opens when the first notification arrives.
+
+__Parameters:__
+
+| Name                                    | Type   | Description                                                             |
+|-----------------------------------------|--------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------|
+| `user_settings[bundle_email_frequency]` | string | `never`, `every_few_hours` (4 hours), `daily`, or `weekly`.              |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "user_settings": {
+    "bundle_email_frequency": "daily"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success, or `422 Unprocessable Entity` for an unknown frequency.
